# Pairs with TypeOK. A model-domain defect: an arrival stamped beyond
# MaxStamp leaves the slot domain.
MODULE: ArrivalStampedPastTheBound
TARGET: TypeOK
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: an arriving slot carries a stamp past the model's stamp bound
PERTURBS: ArriveEntry

--- FIND
    /\ slots' = [slots EXCEPT ![x][e] = MergeSlot(@, Slot(TRUE, PeerStamp))]
--- REPLACE
    /\ slots' = [slots EXCEPT ![x][e] = MergeSlot(@, Slot(TRUE, MaxStamp + 1))]
--- END